<title>CHINA: YGM Trading year net up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>YGM Trading year net up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	    95.0 vs 92.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     35.0 vs 30.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   12.05 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			     145.73 vs 130.03</p>
<p>    Turnover			2,321.51 vs 2,193.51</p>
<p>    Company name		  YGM Trading Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		   Sept 22-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	    Oct 6</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is garement making and property investment concern. Exceptional items represent loss from sale of an 80 percent owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
